      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Sábio. No passado, as pessoas confundiam Oranguru com um humano ao vê-lo dar ordens aos Pokémon da floresta. Ele vive tranquilamente nas profundezas da mata, e sua pelagem roxa semelhante a uma capa cresce com a idade.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 10 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 8 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/1</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Oranguru não possui evoluções conhecidas.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Confusion</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>After You</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Taunt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Quash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Stored Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Psych Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Feint Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Nasty Plot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Zen Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Instruct</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Foul Play</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Calm Mind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Future Sight, Psychic, Trick Room</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>After You, Ally Switch, Attract, Block, Body Slam, Brick Break, Brutal Swing, Bulldoze, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Chilling Water, Confide, Covet, Double Team, Dream Eater, Earthquake, Embargo, Encore, Endeavor, Endure, Energy Ball, Expanding Force, Facade, Fling, Focus Blast, Foul Play, Frustration, Future Sight, Giga Impact, Gravity, Hidden Power, Hyper Beam, Hyper Voice, Imprison, Knock Off, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Magic Room, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Nasty Plot, Nature Power, Pain Split, Payback, Protect, Psybeam, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Noise, Psychic Terrain, Psyshock, Quash, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Return, Rock Slide, Round, Safeguard, Scary Face, Shadow Ball, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Spite, Stored Power, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Taunt, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Terrain Pulse, Thunder, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Trailblaze, Trick, Trick Room, Wonder Room, Work Up, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Dream Eater, Extrasensory, Last Resort, Psychic Terrain, Wonder Room, Yawn</p>",
